The following packages were ported from it:

- desktop/internal/term        from internal/term (the screen and its encoders)
- desktop/internal/localshell  from internal/localshell (the local shell on a pty)
- desktop/internal/shellkind   from internal/shellkind (shell detection)
- desktop/internal/termview    from internal/workbench (the terminal view: the row cache,
                               output pump, painting, selection, input and scrollbar)

Changes: import paths were moved into this module. The terminal view keeps only a local
shell in one pane; Motty's SSH, AI, recording, prediction, links, find, toolbar and
multi-pane parts were left out, and its state, session and terminal types were merged into
one View.
